{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986590/extras/615c2f900248eee6b406bd1fbd148aa7.webp?t=1772711310\" width=720 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986590/extras/6a79d41b54add4c02fd755325fb6cfe8.poster.avif?t=1772711310\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986590/extras/6a79d41b54add4c02fd755325fb6cfe8.webm?t=1772711310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986590/extras/6a79d41b54add4c02fd755325fb6cfe8.mp4?t=1772711310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hey... You're finally awake...!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Congrats on the new job! My name is <strong>Nezzie,</strong> and I'll be your Boss from now on~! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">So, you're probably wondering, what's it like working at HYPNOSYNC anyway?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986590/extras/d40415a22deac4d62d11aeea71f2e721.webp?t=1772711310\" width=720 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986590/extras/12cd86e1d1e9974d561f2aad6a7f9e34.poster.avif?t=1772711310\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986590/extras/12cd86e1d1e9974d561f2aad6a7f9e34.webm?t=1772711310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986590/extras/12cd86e1d1e9974d561f2aad6a7f9e34.mp4?t=1772711310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As manager, your primary task is to hypnotize customers into spending more money at HYPNOSYNC! You have a wide range of <i>cute</i> subjects to choose from... every song has a subject, and every mind can be broken!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986590/extras/822b036c4d20b177d3a04dc4ecbdf23a.poster.avif?t=1772711310\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986590/extras/822b036c4d20b177d3a04dc4ecbdf23a.webm?t=1772711310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986590/extras/822b036c4d20b177d3a04dc4ecbdf23a.mp4?t=1772711310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986590/extras/a659e9e62dec3fa63ee5c3b8d00fde82.webp?t=1772711310\" width=720 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986590/extras/fba93ae9ba2130c606f57f36f2082152.poster.avif?t=1772711310\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986590/extras/fba93ae9ba2130c606f57f36f2082152.webm?t=1772711310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986590/extras/fba93ae9ba2130c606f57f36f2082152.mp4?t=1772711310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hypnosis is easy! All you've gotta do is break their willpower as soon as it reaches the break line. Do this well enough, and their mind is yours~ Willpower is defined by color, and all 5 types of them appear on the same lane.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986590/extras/40a1d944961d3c414b9738a569e8289d.poster.avif?t=1772711310\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986590/extras/40a1d944961d3c414b9738a569e8289d.webm?t=1772711310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986590/extras/f76bbb9f8f00c72cd7f801b2444363e8.webp?t=1772711310\" width=720 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986590/extras/51303ec9be401ae0268ad77104476686.poster.avif?t=1772711310\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986590/extras/51303ec9be401ae0268ad77104476686.webm?t=1772711310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986590/extras/51303ec9be401ae0268ad77104476686.mp4?t=1772711310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The point where your hypnosis is the strongest! Reach Daze Mode and destroy Daze Challenges to get even better!\u00a0If you beat a Daze Challenge, you get Daze Tickets, which you can use in Deep Dive Draw!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986590/extras/8b8c4df434b92b0fb34cfc05f4b1323f.poster.avif?t=1772711310\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986590/extras/8b8c4df434b92b0fb34cfc05f4b1323f.webm?t=1772711310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986590/extras/8b8c4df434b92b0fb34cfc05f4b1323f.mp4?t=1772711310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986590/extras/352c2f1f10a160b8ae42a132fc4a28a3.webp?t=1772711310\" width=720 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986590/extras/b19250d4321779ab5616509bbe2d002f.poster.avif?t=1772711310\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986590/extras/b19250d4321779ab5616509bbe2d002f.webm?t=1772711310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986590/extras/b19250d4321779ab5616509bbe2d002f.mp4?t=1772711310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">An Employee can become your loyal partner. Partners 